Source-coordinate protocol research:
- scripts/verify_source_coordinates.py references MiuRead's wr_co.lua and
  source_position.lua (MiuRead contributors, AGPL-3.0-only). It compares a public
  preview and synthetic fixtures with the current official Web Reader parser.
  Sanitizer-dependent coordinate runs and UTF-16 units were verified against
  the live parser before implementing weread/lib/source_coordinates.lua. The
  pure local Lua core does not enable a new progress-writing contract. Local
  EPUB source binding and chapter-scoped source/DOM conversion are now
  verified, including cross-block anchors and identical chapters. Production
  reader integration and real-account write/readback
  remain pending.
  Official Web JavaScript is loaded for verification, not redistributed.
The home/shelf/store navigation is adapted to the original WeRead services.

