Native authorization protocol prototype:
- scripts/verify_native_discovery.py and the read-only bookstore adapter in
  weread/lib/native_authorization.lua reference MiuRead's eink_client.lua
  (AGPL-3.0-only, MiuRead contributors). Search, recommendations and similar
  books were verified against real Python responses on 2026-11-09 before
  Lua integration. Native Lua HTTPS independently verified pagination;
  the real personalized recommendation result was empty.
- weread/lib/native_authorization.lua adapts MiuRead's shelf_client.lua
  (AGPL-3.0-only, MiuRead contributors), after real owner-scan, login and
  read-only shelf validation by the Python prototype on 2026-11-08.
  It implements QR authorization and renewal after real Python validation.
  The plugin's separate UI, session-bound credential store and memory-pipe
  worker provide authorization, verified local persistence and cancellation;
  renewal includes manual entry and one attempt after a native shelf HTTP 401,
  with a checked on-disk pending marker to prevent uncertain-request replay.
- scripts/verify_eink_login.py adapts the request flow from MiuRead's
  miuread/shelf_client.lua (AGPL-3.0-only, MiuRead contributors) and references
  https://github.com/teng-lin/weread-omni/blob/main/src/auth/qrlogin.ts.
- scripts/verify_eink_readtime.py references MiuRead's miuread/eink_readtime.lua
  and readtime_protocol.lua (AGPL-3.0-only, MiuRead contributors) for read-only
  config/feature/position preflight. It does not implement the write/signature
  algorithm or upload reading time.
- scripts/verify_eink_renewal.py and scripts/verify_eink_shelf_write.py
  reference MiuRead's shelf_client.lua and eink_client.lua (AGPL-3.0-only,
  MiuRead contributors) for renewal and single-book shelf-write prototypes.
  Two renewals and their read-only shelf checks were owner-verified on
  2026-11-08 before Lua renewal integration. The shelf-write contract remains
  unverified and is not integrated into the plugin's Lua API.

Local offline reading-time collection:
- weread/lib/offline_time_stats.lua adapts native statistics extraction from
  miuread/readtime_stats.lua (MiuRead contributors, AGPL-3.0-only).
- The transactional watermarks, conservative restart and uncertain-attempt
  design in offline_time_store.lua and offline_time.lua reference MiuRead's
  readtime_outbox.lua/readtime_controller.lua; rewritten for this repository's
  account databases and offline-only collection on 2026-11-08.
- The file-bound version rule in book_file_identity.lua references MiuRead's
  readtime_metadata.lua (MiuRead contributors, AGPL-3.0-only). EPUB provenance
  encoding, open-document pinning and checkpoint integration are implemented
  for this repository's download and reader lifecycle.
